theorem ex7f: if if b then c else d fi then P else Q fi = if b then if c then P else Q fi else if d then P else Q fi fi
    if if b then c else d fi then P else Q fi    case analysis
=   if b then c else d fi ∧ P ∨ ¬if b then c else d fi ∧ Q    distribute
=   if b then c∧P else d∧P fi ∨ if b then ¬c∧Q else ¬d∧Q fi    distribute
=   if b then c∧P ∨ ¬c∧Q else d∧P ∨ ¬d∧Q fi    case analysis
=   if b then if c then P else Q fi else if d then P else Q fi fi
